# Board topology 1 — two rooms, one door.
# A solid wall splits the map; the only way through is the single tile at (4,3),
# and a Warden is standing in it. Move 0: it never advances, so the door stays corked
# for as long as the Warden is alive. The Anchor that used to hold it left in round 1.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot

id: tp-01-one-door
number: 101
name: One Door
description: A wall with a single gap, corked by the one enemy your basic shove cannot move. Ranged fire crosses the wall; bodies do not.

spawn w = Warden
spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  AA..#....
  AAH.#.h^.
  ....#....
  ....w...l
  ....#....
  BBH.#.h^.
  BB..#....
